{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"1190970","name":"房产达人 2","type":"game","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/42c49fe598d43bd187083456f84fa37c.avif?t=1779718356\" width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/b6ab3ff0859b3398018534fa9b27a0e5.poster.avif?t=1779718356\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/b6ab3ff0859b3398018534fa9b27a0e5.webm?t=1779718356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/b6ab3ff0859b3398018534fa9b27a0e5.mp4?t=1779718356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">邀请你的朋友一起来体验《房产达人 2》——从现在开始，你们可以一起做所有事情免费的 “合作模式 DLC&quot;。得益于跨平台系统，无论您是在主机还是 PC 上玩，都可以在故事模式和沙盒模式中联手，最多可 4 人一起享受乐趣。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/f93b655af9c9dfe3cfeaf928b78171e3.avif?t=1779718356\" width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/5ba9cafd9ff100e389b4cb4da78e8e5e.poster.avif?t=1779718356\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/5ba9cafd9ff100e389b4cb4da78e8e5e.webm?t=1779718356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/5ba9cafd9ff100e389b4cb4da78e8e5e.mp4?t=1779718356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">你们将更快地打造令人惊叹的房产并完成主线故事中的任务。如果您暂时失去了创造力，那么借助 mod.io 平台，你可以前往参观其他达人的房子！不要犹豫，分享您创造的东西 - 您的创作可以让其他达人的时光更加愉快！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/8d7d0fd80c36714f5abb351cb6edb224.avif?t=1779718356\" width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/1203044058e442019cd18cc68fad4f5f.poster.avif?t=1779718356\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/1203044058e442019cd18cc68fad4f5f.webm?t=1779718356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/1203044058e442019cd18cc68fad4f5f.mp4?t=1779718356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">既然可以建一所房子，为什么还要翻新呢？在沙盒模式中你可以释放创造力！建造想象中的房屋或项目。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> 请记住：从头开始构建并非易事！但绝对值得付出额外的努力来设计你梦想中的房子。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/8e3e025aab1c4ae749fcff0f74aec273.avif?t=1779718356\" width=1560 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/b1318d72bbc261d35dfff5f12c7a9217.poster.avif?t=1779718356\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/b1318d72bbc261d35dfff5f12c7a9217.webm?t=1779718356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/extras/b1318d72bbc261d35dfff5f12c7a9217.mp4?t=1779718356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">在山顶和一望无际的大海之间，坐落着拼纳科福镇。 一个让时间慢下来的地方，友好的居民准备把他们的家托付给你。 你知道这些墙内的一些故事吗？ 你的老朋友汤姆似乎认识附近的每个人，他很乐意与你分享一些当地知识。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">在《房产达人 2》 中，你是工头！ 你可以决定“游戏”的含义！ 你喜欢建造吗？选择从头开始建造房屋的沙盒模式。或者更喜欢清洁和装饰？在故事模式中，你可以深入漫长而引人入胜的装修项目，并处理一些快速的工作。 坐下来放松一下，新时代来了！</p>","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1190970/2e63d8ad434abaf906cae2fac3963ff7149e21a9/header_alt_assets_11_schinese.jpg?t=1779718356","website":"https://houseflipper2.com/","developers":["Frozen District"],"publishers":["Frozen District"],"release_date":"2023 年 12 月 14 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"EUR","initial":"37.49","final":"24.36","discount":35},"supported_languages":"英语<strong>*</strong>, 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 荷兰语, 日语, 韩语, 挪威语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 葡萄牙语 - 葡萄牙, 俄语, 简体中文, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 繁体中文, 土耳其语, 乌克兰语<br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","多人","合作","在线合作","局域网合作","跨平台多人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","Steam 集换式卡牌","自定义音量控制","无需应对快速反应事件","随时保存","立体声","Steam 云","包含关卡编辑器","家庭共享"],"genres":["动作","冒险","休闲","独立","大型多人在线","模拟"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br